    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Implement Batch Processing Module - Column Mapping and Template Management",
      "description": "Develop the column mapping interface and template management functionality for the Batch Processing Module.",
      "details": "1. Create frontend components:\n   - ColumnMapper.tsx: Interface for mapping CSV columns to system fields\n   - TemplateManager.tsx: Component for saving and loading mapping templates\n2. Implement backend endpoints:\n   - POST /api/v1/batch/uploads/{upload_id}/map_and_process: Submit column mappings\n   - POST /api/v1/batch/templates: Create a new template\n   - GET /api/v1/batch/templates: List templates\n   - GET /api/v1/batch/templates/{template_id}: Get a specific template\n   - PUT /api/v1/batch/templates/{template_id}: Update a template\n   - DELETE /api/v1/batch/templates/{template_id}: Delete a template\n   - POST /api/v1/batch/templates/{template_id}/apply: Apply template to an upload\n3. Implement column auto-mapping algorithm based on column name similarity\n4. Create UI for specifying default values for unmapped required fields\n5. Implement template storage and retrieval logic\n\nExample column mapping component:\n```typescript\nconst ColumnMapper: React.FC<{\n  sourceColumns: string[];\n  targetFields: {name: string; required: boolean}[];\n  onSubmit: (mappings: Record<string, string>, defaults: Record<string, any>) => void;\n}> = ({ sourceColumns, targetFields, onSubmit }) => {\n  const [mappings, setMappings] = useState<Record<string, string>>({});\n  const [defaults, setDefaults] = useState<Record<string, any>>({});\n  \n  // Auto-mapping on component mount\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const suggestedMappings = {};\n    \n    targetFields.forEach(target => {\n      // Find best match in source columns\n      const bestMatch = sourceColumns.find(src => \n        src.toLowerCase().includes(target.name.toLowerCase()) ||\n        target.name.toLowerCase().includes(src.toLowerCase())\n      );\n      \n      if (bestMatch) {\n        suggestedMappings[target.name] = bestMatch;\n      }\n    });\n    \n    setMappings(suggestedMappings);\n  }, [sourceColumns, targetFields]);\n  \n  const handleMappingChange = (targetField: string, sourceColumn: string) => {\n    setMappings(prev => ({\n      ...prev,\n      [targetField]: sourceColumn\n    }));\n  };\n  \n  const handleDefaultChange = (targetField: string, value: any) => {\n    setDefaults(prev => ({\n      ...prev,\n      [targetField]: value\n    }));\n  };\n  \n  const handleSubmit = () => {\n    onSubmit(mappings, defaults);\n  };\n  \n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Map Columns</h2>\n      \n      {targetFields.map(field => (\n        <div key={field.name} className=\"mb-4\">\n          <label className=\"block mb-2\">\n            {field.name} {field.required && <span className=\"text-red-500\">*</span>}\n          </label>\n          \n          <select\n            value={mappings[field.name] || ''}\n            onChange={(e) => handleMappingChange(field.name, e.target.value)}\n            className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full mb-2\"\n          >\n            <option value=\"\">-- Select source column --</option>\n            {sourceColumns.map(col => (\n              <option key={col} value={col}>{col}</option>\n            ))}\n          </select>\n          \n          {!mappings[field.name] && field.required && (\n            <div>\n              <label className=\"block mb-1 text-sm\">Default value:</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"text\"\n                value={defaults[field.name] || ''}\n                onChange={(e) => handleDefaultChange(field.name, e.target.value)}\n                className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n                required\n              />\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      ))}\n      \n      <button \n        onClick={handleSubmit}\n        className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded\"\n      >\n        Submit Mapping\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```",
      "testStrategy": "1. Unit tests for column mapping components\n2. Integration tests for template management API endpoints\n3. Test auto-mapping algorithm with various column naming conventions\n4. Validate template saving and loading functionality\n5. Test handling of required vs. optional fields\n6. Verify default value application for unmapped fields",
      "priority": "medium",
      "dependencies": [
        4
      ],
      "status": "deferred",
      "subtasks": [
