          "details": "Technical requirements: 1) Build form components for numeric inputs, dropdowns, and toggles; 2) Implement client-side validation for parameter constraints (e.g., weights must sum to 100%, values within specified ranges); 3) Create error/warning indicators with descriptive messages; 4) Design responsive layout that works across device sizes. Validation rules: Implement type checking, range validation, interdependent field validation (e.g., related parameters), and required field validation. Integration points: UI components should emit events when values change to trigger validation and preview calculations.",
