          "details": "Technical requirements: 1) Design schema for parameter storage that includes parameter values, metadata, and validation state; 2) Implement serialization/deserialization of parameter configurations; 3) Create API endpoints for saving and retrieving parameter configurations; 4) Ensure backward compatibility with existing batch records. Validation rules: Server-side validation to ensure data integrity, parameter value constraints, and schema validation. Integration points: Database layer, batch record service, audit logging system for tracking parameter changes.",
          "status": "done"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "title": "Develop Parameter Preset Functionality",
          "description": "Create the ability to save, load, and manage parameter configuration presets.",
