          "details": "Technical requirements: 1) Design UI for saving current parameters as a named preset; 2) Implement preset selection dropdown with preview capability; 3) Create preset management interface (rename, delete, set default); 4) Develop import/export functionality for presets. Validation rules: Validate preset names for uniqueness and format, ensure complete parameter sets in presets, verify preset compatibility with current system configuration. Integration points: User preferences service, parameter storage system, permission system for shared presets.",
