          "details": "Technical requirements: 1) Develop parameter transformation layer to convert UI parameters to calculation engine format; 2) Implement parameter injection into calculation pipeline; 3) Create preview calculation functionality using current parameters; 4) Add parameter validation specific to calculation requirements. Validation rules: Validate parameters against calculation engine constraints, ensure all required parameters are provided, check for parameter combinations that may cause performance issues. Integration points: Calculation engine API, batch processing workflow, results preview system, error handling and reporting system.",
          "status": "done"
