    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Implement Individual Compensation Calculator - Input Panel and Real-time Calculation",
      "description": "Develop the input panel for the Individual Compensation Calculator with real-time bonus calculation updates.",
      "details": "1. Create frontend components:\n   - InputPanel.tsx: Form for adjusting individual compensation parameters\n   - ResultsPanel.tsx: Display of calculation results\n2. Implement state management for input parameters\n3. Create real-time calculation updates using the frontend calculation engine\n4. Implement input controls for all compensation components:\n   - Base Salary & Target Bonus %\n   - Investment Performance Component (Score Multiplier and Weight)\n   - Qualitative Performance Component (Score Multiplier and Weight)\n   - Revenue Adjustment Factor (RAF)\n   - Policy & Cap Adjustments\n5. Add validation for input values\n\nExample input panel component:\n```typescript\nconst InputPanel: React.FC<{\n  initialData: EmployeeData;\n  globalParameters: BatchParameters;\n  onChange: (data: EmployeeData) => void;\n}> = ({ initialData, globalParameters, onChange }) => {\n  const [data, setData] = useState<EmployeeData>(initialData);\n  \n  // Update parent component when data changes\n  useEffect(() => {\n    onChange(data);\n  }, [data, onChange]);\n  \n  const handleChange = (field: keyof EmployeeData, value: any) => {\n    setData(prev => ({\n      ...prev,\n      [field]: value\n    }));\n  };\n  \n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded-lg\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Compensation Inputs</h2>\n      \n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n        {/* Employee Info Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Employee Information</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Employee ID</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              value={data.employee_id || ''}\n              disabled\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full bg-gray-100\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Name</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              value={data.name || ''}\n              disabled\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full bg-gray-100\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Team</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"text\"\n              value={data.team || ''}\n              disabled\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full bg-gray-100\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Base Compensation Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Base Compensation</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Base Salary (£)</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"1000\"\n              value={data.base_salary || 0}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('base_salary', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Target Bonus %</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              max=\"2\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.target_bonus_pct || globalParameters.targetBonusPct || 0}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('target_bonus_pct', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Investment Performance Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Investment Performance</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Investment Score Multiplier</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.investment_score_multiplier || 1}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('investment_score_multiplier', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Investment Weight</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"range\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              max=\"1\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.investment_weight || globalParameters.investmentWeight || 0.6}\n              onChange={(e) => {\n                const value = Number(e.target.value);\n                handleChange('investment_weight', value);\n                handleChange('qualitative_weight', 1 - value);\n              }}\n              className=\"w-full\"\n            />\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n              <span>0%</span>\n              <span>{((data.investment_weight || globalParameters.investmentWeight || 0.6) * 100).toFixed(0)}%</span>\n              <span>100%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Qualitative Performance Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Qualitative Performance</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Qualitative Score Multiplier</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.qual_score_multiplier || 1}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('qual_score_multiplier', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Qualitative Weight</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"range\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              max=\"1\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.qualitative_weight || globalParameters.qualitativeWeight || 0.4}\n              onChange={(e) => {\n                const value = Number(e.target.value);\n                handleChange('qualitative_weight', value);\n                handleChange('investment_weight', 1 - value);\n              }}\n              className=\"w-full\"\n            />\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n              <span>0%</span>\n              <span>{((data.qualitative_weight || globalParameters.qualitativeWeight || 0.4) * 100).toFixed(0)}%</span>\n              <span>100%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* RAF Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Revenue Adjustment Factor (RAF)</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">RAF Value</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={data.raf || 1}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('raf', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Policy Settings Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Policy Settings</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2 flex items-center\">\n            <input\n              type=\"checkbox\"\n              checked={data.is_mrt || false}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('is_mrt', e.target.checked)}\n              className=\"mr-2\"\n              id=\"is_mrt\"\n            />\n            <label htmlFor=\"is_mrt\" className=\"text-sm\">Material Risk Taker (MRT)</label>\n          </div>\n          \n          {data.is_mrt && (\n            <div className=\"mb-2\">\n              <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">MRT Cap %</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                step=\"0.01\"\n                value={data.mrt_cap_pct || globalParameters.mrtCapPct || 1}\n                onChange={(e) => handleChange('mrt_cap_pct', Number(e.target.value))}\n                className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n              />\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```",
      "testStrategy": "1. Unit tests for input panel component\n2. Integration tests for real-time calculation updates\n3. Test input validation and constraints\n4. Verify calculation accuracy using test cases from the truth table\n5. Test performance of real-time updates\n6. Validate handling of edge cases and invalid inputs",
      "priority": "medium",
      "dependencies": [
        3,
        8
      ],
      "status": "done",
      "subtasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Implement Individual Compensation Calculator - Results Display and Visualization",
      "description": "Develop the results display and visualization components for the Individual Compensation Calculator.",
      "details": "1. Create frontend components:\n   - ResultsPanel.tsx: Display of calculation results\n   - BonusBreakdown.tsx: Detailed breakdown of bonus calculation\n   - AlertsPanel.tsx: Display of policy alerts\n   - (Optional V1.1) VisualizationPanel.tsx: Charts for bonus composition and sensitivity\n2. Implement clear display of the final bonus amount\n3. Create detailed breakdown of calculation steps\n4. Add alerts for policy breaches (e.g., bonus exceeding 3x base salary, MRT cap)\n5. (Optional V1.1) Implement visualizations for bonus composition and sensitivity\n6. Add export functionality for individual calculation results\n\nExample results panel component:\n```typescript\nconst ResultsPanel: React.FC<{\n  calculationResult: CalculationResult;\n}> = ({ calculationResult }) => {\n  const {\n    target_bonus,\n    weighted_performance,\n    pre_raf_bonus,\n    initial_bonus,\n    base_salary_cap,\n    mrt_cap,\n    final_bonus,\n    cap_applied\n  } = calculationResult;\n  \n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded-lg\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Calculation Results</h2>\n      \n      {/* Final Bonus Display */}\n      <div className=\"mb-6 p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg text-center\">\n        <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold mb-1\">Final Bonus</h3>\n        <p className=\"text-3xl font-bold text-blue-700\">£{final_bonus.toLocaleString(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}</p>\n        \n        {cap_applied && (\n          <div className=\"mt-2 p-2 bg-yellow-100 rounded text-sm text-yellow-800\">\n            {cap_applied === '3x_base' ? (\n              <p>Capped at 3× Base Salary (£{base_salary_cap.toLocaleString()})</p>\n            ) : cap_applied === 'mrt' ? (\n              <p>MRT Cap Applied (£{mrt_cap.toLocaleString()})</p>\n            ) : null}\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </div>\n      \n      {/* Calculation Breakdown */}\n      <div className=\"mb-4\">\n        <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Calculation Breakdown</h3>\n        \n        <table className=\"w-full border-collapse\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr className=\"border-b\">\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-sm\">Target Bonus</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">£{target_bonus.toLocaleString(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"border-b\">\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-sm\">Weighted Performance</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">{weighted_performance.toFixed(2)}×</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"border-b\">\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-sm\">Pre-RAF Bonus</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">£{pre_raf_bonus.toLocaleString(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"border-b\">\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-sm\">RAF Applied</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">{(initial_bonus / pre_raf_bonus).toFixed(2)}×</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"border-b\">\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-sm\">Initial Bonus</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">£{initial_bonus.toLocaleString(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}</td>\n            </tr>\n            {cap_applied && (\n              <tr className=\"border-b bg-yellow-50\">\n                <td className=\"py-2 text-sm font-bold\">Cap Applied</td>\n                <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono font-bold\">\n                  {cap_applied === '3x_base' ? '3× Base Salary' : 'MRT Cap'}\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            )}\n            <tr className=\"border-b font-bold\">\n              <td className=\"py-2\">Final Bonus</td>\n              <td className=\"py-2 text-right font-mono\">£{final_bonus.toLocaleString(undefined, { maximumFractionDigits: 0 })}</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      \n      {/* Export Button */}\n      <div className=\"mt-4\">\n        <button \n          onClick={() => {\n            // Export logic here\n            const csvContent = `Target Bonus,£${target_bonus}\\n` +\n                            `Weighted Performance,${weighted_performance}\\n` +\n                            `Pre-RAF Bonus,£${pre_raf_bonus}\\n` +\n                            `RAF Applied,${(initial_bonus / pre_raf_bonus).toFixed(2)}\\n` +\n                            `Initial Bonus,£${initial_bonus}\\n` +\n                            `${cap_applied ? 'Cap Applied,' + (cap_applied === '3x_base' ? '3× Base Salary' : 'MRT Cap') + '\\n' : ''}` +\n                            `Final Bonus,£${final_bonus}`;\n            \n            const blob = new Blob([csvContent], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8;' });\n            const link = document.createElement('a');\n            const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n            link.setAttribute('href', url);\n            link.setAttribute('download', 'bonus_calculation.csv');\n            link.style.visibility = 'hidden';\n            document.body.appendChild(link);\n            link.click();\n            document.body.removeChild(link);\n          }}\n          className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-green-500 text-white rounded\"\n        >\n          Export Results\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```",
      "testStrategy": "1. Unit tests for results display components\n2. Verify calculation breakdown is accurate and complete\n3. Test alert display for policy breaches\n4. Validate export functionality produces correct files\n5. (If implemented) Test visualizations for accuracy and responsiveness\n6. Test with various calculation scenarios from the truth table",
      "priority": "medium",
      "dependencies": [
        9
      ],
      "status": "done",
      "subtasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Implement Scenario Playground Module - Data Seeding",
      "description": "Develop the functionality to seed the Scenario Playground with data from a processed batch or individual calculator.",
      "details": "1. Create frontend components:\n   - ScenarioPlayground.tsx: Main container for the scenario playground\n   - DataSourceSelector.tsx: Component for selecting the data source\n2. Implement backend endpoints:\n   - POST /api/v1/scenarios: Create a new scenario\n   - GET /api/v1/scenarios/{scenario_id}: Get a saved scenario\n3. Create data seeding functionality:\n   - From a processed batch\n   - (Optional) From an individual employee\n4. Implement state management for scenario data\n\nExample data source selector component:\n```typescript\nconst DataSourceSelector: React.FC<{\n  onSourceSelect: (source: { type: 'batch' | 'individual', id: number }) => void;\n}> = ({ onSourceSelect }) => {\n  const [batches, setBatches] = useState<BatchUpload[]>([]);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    const fetchBatches = async () => {\n      try {\n        setLoading(true);\n        const response = await fetch('/api/v1/batch/uploads');\n        \n        if (!response.ok) {\n          throw new Error('Failed to fetch batches');\n        }\n        \n        const data = await response.json();\n        setBatches(data.filter(batch => batch.status === 'completed'));\n      } catch (err) {\n        setError(err.message || 'An error occurred');\n      } finally {\n        setLoading(false);\n      }\n    };\n    \n    fetchBatches();\n  }, []);\n  \n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded-lg\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Select Data Source for Scenario</h2>\n      \n      {loading ? (\n        <p>Loading data sources...</p>\n      ) : error ? (\n        <p className=\"text-red-500\">{error}</p>\n      ) : (\n        <div>\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Available Batches</h3>\n          \n          {batches.length === 0 ? (\n            <p className=\"text-gray-500\">No completed batches available</p>\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"space-y-2\">\n              {batches.map(batch => (\n                <div key={batch.id} className=\"p-3 border rounded hover:bg-gray-50 cursor-pointer\"\n                     onClick={() => onSourceSelect({ type: 'batch', id: batch.id })}>\n                  <p className=\"font-medium\">{batch.filename}</p>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">\n                    Uploaded: {new Date(batch.uploaded_at).toLocaleString()}\n                  </p>\n                  <p className=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">\n                    {batch.employee_count || 0} employees\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          )}\n          \n          {/* Individual employee selection could be added here if implemented */}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```",
      "testStrategy": "1. Unit tests for data source selection component\n2. Integration tests for scenario creation API endpoints\n3. Test data seeding from batch results\n4. (If implemented) Test data seeding from individual employee\n5. Verify state management correctly initializes with seeded data\n6. Test handling of invalid or incomplete data sources",
      "priority": "medium",
      "dependencies": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "status": "done",
      "subtasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Implement Scenario Playground Module - Parameter Adjustment and Impact Assessment",
      "description": "Develop the interface for adjusting global calculation parameters in the Scenario Playground and assessing their impact on the dataset.",
      "details": "1. Create frontend components:\n   - ScenarioParameterPanel.tsx: Interface for adjusting global parameters\n   - ScenarioResultsPanel.tsx: Display of scenario calculation results\n2. Implement parameter adjustment for:\n   - RAF sensitivity and clamp values\n   - MRT Cap %\n   - Investment/Qualitative weights\n   - Parameters for performance-to-multiplier curves\n3. Create real-time recalculation of bonuses for the entire dataset\n4. Implement summary statistics updates\n\nExample scenario parameter panel component:\n```typescript\nconst ScenarioParameterPanel: React.FC<{\n  initialParameters: ScenarioParameters;\n  onChange: (parameters: ScenarioParameters) => void;\n}> = ({ initialParameters, onChange }) => {\n  const [parameters, setParameters] = useState<ScenarioParameters>(initialParameters);\n  \n  // Update parent component when parameters change\n  useEffect(() => {\n    onChange(parameters);\n  }, [parameters, onChange]);\n  \n  const handleChange = (field: keyof ScenarioParameters, value: number | boolean) => {\n    setParameters(prev => {\n      const updated = {\n        ...prev,\n        [field]: value\n      };\n      \n      // If investment weight changes, adjust qualitative weight to maintain sum of 1\n      if (field === 'investmentWeight') {\n        updated.qualitativeWeight = 1 - Number(value);\n      } else if (field === 'qualitativeWeight') {\n        updated.investmentWeight = 1 - Number(value);\n      }\n      \n      return updated;\n    });\n  };\n  \n  return (\n    <div className=\"p-4 border rounded-lg\">\n      <h2 className=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Scenario Parameters</h2>\n      \n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n        {/* Performance Weights Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Performance Weights</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Investment Weight</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"range\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              max=\"1\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.investmentWeight}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('investmentWeight', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"w-full\"\n            />\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n              <span>0%</span>\n              <span>{(parameters.investmentWeight * 100).toFixed(0)}%</span>\n              <span>100%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">Qualitative Weight</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"range\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              max=\"1\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.qualitativeWeight}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('qualitativeWeight', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"w-full\"\n            />\n            <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n              <span>0%</span>\n              <span>{(parameters.qualitativeWeight * 100).toFixed(0)}%</span>\n              <span>100%</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* RAF Settings Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">RAF Settings</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">RAF Sensitivity Factor</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.rafSensitivity}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('rafSensitivity', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">RAF Lower Clamp</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.rafLowerClamp}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('rafLowerClamp', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">RAF Upper Clamp</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.rafUpperClamp}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('rafUpperClamp', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        {/* Cap Settings Section */}\n        <div className=\"mb-4\">\n          <h3 className=\"font-bold mb-2\">Cap Settings</h3>\n          \n          <div className=\"mb-2\">\n            <label className=\"block text-sm mb-1\">MRT Cap %</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"0\"\n              step=\"0.01\"\n              value={parameters.mrtCapPct}\n              onChange={(e) => handleChange('mrtCapPct', Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"p-2 border rounded w-full\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n```",
      "testStrategy": "1. Unit tests for parameter adjustment components\n2. Integration tests for real-time recalculation\n3. Test parameter validation and constraints\n4. Verify calculation accuracy for the entire dataset\n5. Test performance with large datasets\n6. Validate summary statistics updates",
